{"book_name":"常用口语词汇","g_id":139871,"category":"留学","scene":"其他","s_id":219,"word_total":25,"chapter_total":190,"source":"idictation.cn","chapters":[{"chapter_id":532758,"name":"咖啡","word_count":25,"words":[{"w":"coffee maker","tr":"phrase. 咖啡机；咖啡制造器","uk":"ˈkɒfi ˌmeɪkə","us":"ˈkɔːfi ˌmeɪkər","ex":"He bought a new coffee maker last week.","ex_cn":"他上周买了一个新的咖啡机。","en":"A coffee maker is a kitchen appliance used to brew coffee."},{"w":"frother","tr":"n. 泡沫发生器；打泡器（常用于咖啡或奶昔制作中产生泡沫的工具）","uk":"ˈfrɒðə(r)","us":"ˈfrɑːðər","ex":"He uses a frother to make milk foam for coffee.","ex_cn":"他用奶泡器为咖啡制作奶泡。","en":"A person or device that creates froth, especially in milk."},{"w":"mug stand","tr":"phrase. 马克杯架；杯子置物架","uk":"mʌɡ stænd","us":"mʌɡ stænd","ex":"He put his mug on the mug stand.","ex_cn":"他把杯子放在杯架上。","en":"A stand designed to hold mugs."},{"w":"Device","tr":"n. 设备；装置；手段；","uk":"dɪˈvaɪs","us":"dɪˈvaɪs","ex":"He bought a new device to take photos.","ex_cn":"他买了一个新设备来拍照。","en":"A device is an object or machine that has been invented for a particular purpose."},{"w":"coffee mug","tr":"phrase. 咖啡杯；马克杯","uk":"ˈkɒfi mʌɡ","us":"ˈkoʊfi mʌɡ","ex":"She sipped her coffee from a ceramic coffee mug.","ex_cn":"她从一个陶瓷咖啡杯中啜饮咖啡。","en":"A container, typically ceramic or porcelain, used for drinking coffee."},{"w":"K-cup","tr":"n. K-Cup（一种用于Keurig咖啡机的单次冲泡咖啡胶囊，通常为塑料或纸质小袋，内含咖啡粉或茶叶）","uk":"keɪ kʌp","us":"keɪ kʌp","ex":"He uses a k-cup to make coffee every morning.","ex_cn":"他每天早上用一个k-cup来煮咖啡。","en":"A small, single-serve coffee pod used in specific machines."},{"w":"Plastic","tr":"n. 塑料；\nadj. 塑料的；","uk":"ˈplæstɪk","us":"ˈplæstɪk","ex":"The bottle is made of plastic.","ex_cn":"这个瓶子是塑料做的。","en":"A plastic is a material which is produced from oil by a chemical process and which is used to make many objects. It is light in weight and does not break easily."},{"w":"Syrup","tr":"n. 糖浆；","uk":"ˈsɪrəp","us":"ˈsɪrəp","ex":"He poured syrup on his pancakes.","ex_cn":"他把糖浆倒在煎饼上。","en":"A thick, sweet liquid made by dissolving sugar in boiling water, often used as a topping for desserts or as a sweetener in drinks."},{"w":"thick","tr":"adj. 厚的；粗的；浓稠的；","uk":"θɪk","us":"θɪk","ex":"The book has a thick cover.","ex_cn":"这本书有厚厚的封面。","en":"Having a large distance between the top and bottom or front and back surfaces; not thin."},{"w":"flavoring","tr":"n. 调味品；调料； v. “flavor”的现在分词；","uk":"ˈfleɪvərɪŋ","us":"ˈfleɪvərɪŋ","ex":"She added vanilla flavoring to the cake.","ex_cn":"她给蛋糕加了香草调味品。","en":"A substance used to give a particular taste to food or drink."},{"w":"brew coffee","tr":"verb. 冲泡咖啡；煮咖啡","uk":"bruː ˈkɒfi","us":"bruː ˈkoʊfi","ex":"He brews coffee every morning.","ex_cn":"他每天早上煮咖啡。","en":"To make coffee by steeping ground beans in hot water."},{"w":"Freezer","tr":"n. 冷冻柜；冰柜；","uk":"ˈfriːzə(r)","us":"ˈfriːzər","ex":"She put the ice cream in the freezer.","ex_cn":"她把冰淇淋放进冷冻柜里。","en":"A freezer is a device that is used to store food at very low temperatures in order to preserve it."},{"w":"frozen","tr":"adj. 冰冻的；冻结的； v. “freeze”的过去分词；","uk":"ˈfrəʊz(ə)n","us":"ˈfrəʊz(ə)n","ex":"The frozen fish tastes fresh.","ex_cn":"冰冻的鱼尝起来很新鲜。","en":"If something is frozen, it has been turned into ice or has become very hard because of cold temperature."},{"w":"ice cube tray","tr":"n. 冰块托盘；用于制作冰块的塑料或金属容器","uk":"ˈaɪs kjuːb treɪ","us":"ˈaɪs kjuːb treɪ","ex":"He filled the ice cube tray with water.","ex_cn":"他把水倒进了冰格里。","en":"A plastic or silicone tray with compartments used to freeze water into small cubes of ice."},{"w":"Compartment","tr":"n. 分隔间；","uk":"kəmˈpɑːtmənt","us":"kəmˈpɑːrtmənt","ex":"The train has a sleeping compartment for passengers.","ex_cn":"火车上有一个供乘客休息的隔间。","en":"A compartment is a separate section or part of something, especially a space in a vehicle that is separated from other spaces."},{"w":"ice sphere","tr":"n. 冰球；球形冰块","uk":"aɪs ˈsfɪə(r)","us":"aɪs ˈspɪr","ex":"The bartender made an ice sphere for the whiskey.","ex_cn":"调酒师为威士忌做了一个冰球。","en":"A spherical piece of ice, often used in cocktails to melt slowly and dilute drinks less."},{"w":"cocktails","tr":"n. 混合物; 鸡尾酒( cocktail的名词复数 ); 餐前开胃菜","uk":"ˈkɒkteɪlz","us":"ˈkɑːkteɪlz","ex":"He drinks cocktails at the party.","ex_cn":"他在派对上喝鸡尾酒。","en":"Alcoholic drinks served before a meal or as a social drink, typically mixed with other ingredients."},{"w":"Coffee creamer","tr":"n. 咖啡增白剂；咖啡奶精（用于加入咖啡中以增加口感和颜色的乳制品或非乳制品）","uk":"ˈkɒfi ˈkriːmə(r)","us":"ˈkɑːfi ˈkriːmər","ex":"He adds coffee creamer to his morning coffee.","ex_cn":"他早上在咖啡里加咖啡奶精。","en":"A liquid or powdered product added to coffee to add creaminess and flavor, often non-dairy."},{"w":"powder","tr":"n. 粉末；粉；","uk":"ˈpaʊdə(r)","us":"ˈpaʊdər","ex":"He spilled powder on the floor.","ex_cn":"他把粉末撒在了地上。","en":"A powder is a dry substance made up of very small particles. It can be used for various purposes, including cosmetics, cleaning, and cooking. As a verb, to powder means to apply or cover something with powder."},{"w":"flavor","tr":"n. 风味；味道；特色；","uk":"ˈfleɪvə(r)","us":"ˈfleɪvər","ex":"The cake has a sweet flavor.","ex_cn":"这个蛋糕有一种甜味。","en":"The flavor of a food or drink is its taste, especially a pleasant or distinctive one."},{"w":"glass straw","tr":"n. 玻璃吸管","uk":"ɡlɑːs strɔː","us":"ɡlæs strɔː","ex":"He drinks juice through a glass straw.","ex_cn":"他用玻璃吸管喝果汁。","en":"A drinking straw made of glass, typically reusable and transparent."},{"w":"milk foam","tr":"n. 奶泡；牛奶经蒸汽打发后形成的绵密泡沫","uk":"mɪlk fəʊm","us":"mɪlk foʊm","ex":"She poured milk foam on top of the coffee.","ex_cn":"她把奶泡倒在咖啡上面。","en":"A light, frothy layer of milk, often created by steaming or frothing milk for beverages."},{"w":"frothy","tr":"adj. 起泡的；多泡沫的","uk":"ˈfrɒθi","us":"ˈfrɔːθi","ex":"The milk is frothy after being steamed.","ex_cn":"牛奶经过蒸汽处理后变得泡沫丰富。","en":"Frothy describes something that is full of or covered with a mass of small bubbles, or something that is light and entertaining but not serious."},{"w":"oat milk","tr":"phrase. 燕麦奶；燕麦乳（由燕麦制成的植物奶）","uk":"əʊt mɪlk","us":"oʊt mɪlk","ex":"He drinks oat milk every morning.","ex_cn":"他每天早上喝燕麦奶。","en":"A plant-based milk alternative made from oats, water, and sometimes added vitamins or minerals."},{"w":"substitute","tr":"n. 代用品；代替物；\nv. 替代；","uk":"ˈsʌbstɪtjuːt","us":"ˈsʌbstɪtuːt","ex":"Honey is a good substitute for sugar.","ex_cn":"蜂蜜是糖的良好代用品。","en":"A substitute is something or someone that takes the place or function of another."}]},{"chapter_id":532759,"name":"list2","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532760,"name":"list3","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532761,"name":"list4","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532762,"name":"list5","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532763,"name":"list6","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532764,"name":"list7","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532765,"name":"list8","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532766,"name":"list9","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532767,"name":"list10","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532768,"name":"list11","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532769,"name":"list12","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532770,"name":"list13","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532771,"name":"list14","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532772,"name":"list15","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532773,"name":"list16","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532774,"name":"list17","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532775,"name":"list18","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532776,"name":"list19","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532777,"name":"list20","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532778,"name":"list21","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532779,"name":"list22","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532780,"name":"list23","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532781,"name":"list24","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532782,"name":"list25","word_count":0,"words":[]},{"chapter_id":532783,"name":"list26","word_c